{"unit_id":"SilverCrossing__approval-note-card#card-zh","repo":"SilverCrossing/approval-note-card","commit":"9b2166e90864dbf9855cf1c80865434feab525cc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"approval-note-card（DSH 网页客户端插件）：为审批卡加入拒绝说明输入框。它在浏览器端接管 conversation.composer 中可回答的审批交互，并保留原生审批卡作为未匹配时的回退。用户可以填写理由后将其作为当前会话的一条 steer 消息送给模型，再拒绝本次调用；也可以直接拒绝或允许一次。它适合希望在拒绝工具调用时补充原因、引导当前会话后续处理的网页端 DSH 用户。插件没有额外 API 密钥或外部服务配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:179-184","client.js:242-258","client.js:325-348"]}
{"unit_id":"SilverCrossing__approval-note-card#card-en","repo":"SilverCrossing/approval-note-card","commit":"9b2166e90864dbf9855cf1c80865434feab525cc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"approval-note-card (DSH web plugin): Adds a note field to approval cards. Users can send a reason to the current session before rejecting, reject directly, or allow once. Unmatched interactions use the stock card. No API key or external service is configured.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:179-184","client.js:242-258","client.js:325-348"]}
