{"unit_id":"SilverCrossing__approval-note-card#feature-1","repo":"SilverCrossing/approval-note-card","commit":"9b2166e90864dbf9855cf1c80865434feab525cc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"approval-note-card 的功能「拒绝并说明」：在审批卡输入拒绝理由并提交，文本先作为当前会话的 steer 消息发送，发送成功后再拒绝本次调用；发送失败时卡片保持可重试。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:236-258","client.js:340-348"]}
{"unit_id":"SilverCrossing__approval-note-card#feature-2","repo":"SilverCrossing/approval-note-card","commit":"9b2166e90864dbf9855cf1c80865434feab525cc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"approval-note-card 的功能「审批卡作答」：对待处理的审批提供直接拒绝和允许一次按钮；只有符合可回答审批形状的交互才由该卡片接管。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:179-184","client.js:306-310"]}
{"unit_id":"SilverCrossing__approval-note-card#feature-3","repo":"SilverCrossing/approval-note-card","commit":"9b2166e90864dbf9855cf1c80865434feab525cc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"approval-note-card 的功能「键盘提交说明」：在说明输入框中按 Enter 提交非空理由，Shift+Enter 保留换行；输入法组合期间不会触发提交。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:267-276"]}
{"unit_id":"SilverCrossing__approval-note-card#caveat-1","repo":"SilverCrossing/approval-note-card","commit":"9b2166e90864dbf9855cf1c80865434feab525cc","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"approval-note-card 使用前须知：说明通过 steer 插入当前轮；若拒绝会取消整轮，说明可能无法送达。（见 client.js:16-19、client.js:340-348）","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:16-19","client.js:340-348"]}
